# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit .env.
#
# Warning: Vite inlines every VITE_-prefixed variable into the built bundle.
# Running "npm run deploy" publishes this key inside public JavaScript on
# GitHub Pages. Keep a hard usage limit on the Deepgram project and rotate
# the key periodically. See CLAUDE.md, "Deepgram and the API key".
VITE_DEEPGRAM_API_KEY=
